    count: 3-4
    placement: each marker lies on one of the 12 rays extending from the 12 ring cells of the block
    ray_types: cardinal (N/S rows aligned with bc0 or bc1; E/W rows aligned with br0 or br1) or diagonal (exact 45-degree from a ring corner)
